# Preview endpoints only — committed. Secrets (MN_WALLET_SEED, MN_PRIVATE_STATE_PASSWORD) go in
# .env / .env.local, which are git-ignored. See midnight-deployment SKILL.md §2.
#
# WHY PREVIEW AND NOT PREPROD: this is the only Midnight testnet with real USDM. The VIA Labs
# bridge pairs Cardano Preprod <-> Midnight PREVIEW; there is no USDM on Midnight Preprod.
# See docs/ROADMAP.md "The network trap".
#
# Measured 2026-09-13, same `{ block { height } }` query against both indexers:
#   preview  200 in  1.06 s  (height ~837,939)
#   preprod  200 in 30.66 s  (height ~2,522,119)
# Preview is both far healthier and ~1/3 the chain history, so a cold genesis sync is much cheaper.
#
# Faucet (CAPTCHA-gated, cannot be scripted — a human must request funds):
#   https://midnight-tmnight-preview.nethermind.dev/
# Fund the address printed by `pnpm run print-address`, NOT a browser-wallet address.

MN_NETWORK=preview
MN_INDEXER=https://indexer.preview.midnight.network/api/v4/graphql
MN_INDEXER_WS=wss://indexer.preview.midnight.network/api/v4/graphql/ws
MN_RPC=https://rpc.preview.midnight.network
MN_PROOF_SERVER=http://localhost:6300
